# Vue Components

- Prefer `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Keep route-level orchestration in `src/views/`.
- Keep screen-level UI flows in `src/screens/`.
- Keep reusable UI in `src/components/`.
- Prefer composables for business logic instead of embedding it in templates.
- Keep component state local unless it belongs to a shared domain store.
